<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec housing starts up 1.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec housing starts up 1.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts rose 1.4 percent in December from a year earlier to 137,594 units, and were up 11.8 percent to 1,643,266 units in 1996 from a year earlier, the Construction Ministry said on Friday.  </p>
<p>				    Dec starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			48,726	   +6.9</p>
<p> Rental homes			 56,860	   -1.1</p>
<p> Employee housing		    1,918	  -10.8</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   30,090	   -1.4</p>
<p> Total				 137,594	   +1.4</p>
</text>
